{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Eb]Glory be to the [Bb7]Father,
[Eb]and [Bb]to the [Eb]Son,
and [Bb]to [Eb]the [Bb]Ho[F7]ly [Bb]Ghost;
As it [Eb]was in [Ab]the [Eb]be[Bb]gin[Bb7]ning,
is now, and ever [Ebsus]shall [Eb]be,
[Bb7]world without [Eb]end.
A-[Fm][Eb]men, [Bb7]A--[Eb]men.
{end_of_verse}
